    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477129\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Antemortal Existence of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477130\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-creator?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Creator</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-foreordained?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Foreordained</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-jehovah?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Jehovah</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477131\" id=\"p1\">In the <span class=\"key-word\">beginning</span> was the Word … and the Word was God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">John 1:1</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">1 Jn. 1:1</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">5:7</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477132\" id=\"p2\">no man hath ascended up to heaven, but he that <span class=\"key-word\">came down</span> from heaven, even the Son of man, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">John 3:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477133\" id=\"p3\">What and if ye shall see the Son of man ascend up where he was <span class=\"key-word\">before</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p62#p62\">John 6:62</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477134\" id=\"p4\"><span class=\"key-word\">Before</span> Abraham was, I am, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p58#p58\">John 8:58</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477135\" id=\"p5\">I <span class=\"key-word\">came forth</span> from the Father, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">John 16:28</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477136\" id=\"p6\">glorify thou me … with the glory which I had with thee <span class=\"key-word\">before</span> the world was, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">John 17:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477137\" id=\"p7\">on the morrow <span class=\"key-word\">come</span> I into the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">3 Ne. 1:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477138\" id=\"p8\">Christ, who was <span class=\"key-word\">before</span> the world began, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">3 Ne. 26:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477139\" id=\"p9\">even as I <span class=\"key-word\">appear</span> unto thee … will I appear unto my people in the flesh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Ether 3:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477140\" id=\"p10\">my Beloved Son, which was my Beloved and Chosen from the <span class=\"key-word\">beginning</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Moses 4:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477141\" id=\"p11\">Whom shall I send … the Son of Man: Here am I, <span class=\"key-word\">send</span> me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Abr. 3:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477142\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Eph. 1:4</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/2-tim/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">2 Tim. 1:9</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">1 Pet. 1:20</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Mosiah 7:27</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p13-p14#p13\">D&amp;C 76:13–14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
